@startuml
actor Client
participant "Auth API" as API
database "DB" as DB

== Login ==
Client -> API : POST /auth/login (email, pwd)
API -> DB : getUserByEmail(email)
DB --> API : user + pwdHash
API -> API : verify pwd (Argon2id)
API -> API : create ACCESS (JWT, exp=15m)\ncreate REFRESH (JWT/opaque, jti, exp=7d)
API -> API : hash = SHA-256(refresh)
API -> DB : INSERT refresh_tokens(jti, user_id, hash, exp, revoked=false, rotated_from=null, created_at)
DB --> API : ok
API --> Client : 200\nSet-Cookie(HttpOnly+Secure: refresh)\nBody: access_token

== Appels protégés ==
Client -> API : GET /resource\nAuthorization: Bearer ACCESS
API -> API : jwtVerify(ACCESS, publicKey)
API --> Client : 200 (data)

== ACCESS expiré ==
Client -> API : GET /resource (ACCESS expiré)
API --> Client : 401 (use refresh)

== Refresh avec rotation ==
Client -> API : POST /auth/refresh (Cookie: refresh)
API -> API : hash = SHA-256(refresh)
API -> DB : SELECT * FROM refresh_tokens WHERE hash = ?
DB --> API : row (exists, not revoked, not expired?)
API -> API : verify jwt(refresh) & jti match
API -> API : generate new ACCESS, new REFRESH (new jti2)
API -> API : newHash = SHA-256(newRefresh)
API -> DB : UPDATE refresh_tokens SET revoked=true, rotated_to=jti2 WHERE jti=oldJti
API -> DB : INSERT refresh_tokens(jti2, user_id, newHash, exp2, revoked=false, rotated_from=oldJti)
DB --> API : ok
API --> Client : 200\nSet-Cookie(new refresh)\nBody: new access_token

== Logout ==
Client -> API : POST /auth/logout
API -> API : read refresh from cookie
API -> API : hash = SHA-256(refresh)
API -> DB : UPDATE refresh_tokens SET revoked=true WHERE hash=?
DB --> API : ok
API --> Client : 204 (clear cookie)

== Échecs ==
Client -> API : POST /auth/refresh (invalide/expiré)
API -> DB : lookup by hash
DB --> API : not found OR revoked OR expired
API --> Client : 401 (login required)
@enduml
